      "id": "s5.notes.p1",
      "slide": 5,
      "kind": "notes",
      "text": "Define Foundry in one sentence: “Foundry gives you a project‑based workspace to build AI apps/agents with models, tools, and knowledge in one place.”",
      "context": "Microsoft Foundry"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5.notes.p2",
      "slide": 5,
      "kind": "notes",
      "text": "Emphasize the mental model: <b>Resources</b> provide compute/storage/model delivery services.",
